# Component System
ViewComponent-based design system built with Tokyo Night theming.
## Architecture
**Component Organization:**
- `app/components/` - All component classes and templates
- `spec/components/previews/` - Lookbook preview definitions
- Namespace modules: `UI::`, `Card::`, `Terminal::`, `Hero::`, etc.
**Base Component:**
All components extend `ApplicationComponent` which provides:
- Shared helper methods
- Consistent rendering patterns
- Tokyo Night color tokens via `TokyoNightTokens` concern
## Tokyo Night Design Tokens
### Color Palette
Primary colors defined in `TokyoNightTokens`:
| Color | Hex | Usage |
|-------|-----|-------|
| Blue | `#7aa2f7` | Primary actions, links |
| Purple | `#bb9af7` | Accents, highlights |
| Cyan | `#7dcfff` | Info states |
| Green | `#9ece6a` | Success states |
| Orange | `#ff9e64` | Warnings |
| Red | `#f7768e` | Errors |
| Yellow | `#e0af68` | Cautions |
### Background Colors
| Name | Hex | Usage |
|------|-----|-------|
| bg | `#1a1b26` | Primary background |
| bg_dark | `#16161e` | Darker backgrounds |
| bg_float | `#1f2335` | Floating elements |
