## Component Categories
### UI Components
Base interactive elements:
- `UI::ButtonComponent` - Buttons with variants
- `UI::BadgeComponent` - Status badges
- `UI::IconComponent` - Font Awesome icons
- `UI::LinkComponent` - Styled links
### Card Components
Content containers:
- `Card::BaseComponent` - Base card with header/footer slots
- `Card::PostComponent` - Blog post cards
- `Card::ProjectComponent` - Project showcase cards
### Terminal Components
Terminal-themed UI elements:
- `Terminal::Component` - Terminal window container
- `Terminal::PromptComponent` - Command prompt
- `Terminal::OutputComponent` - Command output
### Layout Components
Page structure:
- `Layout::PageComponent` - Page wrapper
- `Layout::SectionComponent` - Content sections
- `Layout::GridComponent` - Responsive grids
- `Layout::ContainerComponent` - Max-width containers
### Animation Components
Entrance effects:
- `Animations::FadeInComponent` - Fade in on scroll
- `Animations::SlideUpComponent` - Slide up on scroll
## Conventions
**Naming:** Component classes use `Component` suffix (`ButtonComponent`, not `Button`)
**Slots:** Prefer slots over content blocks for multi-part components
**Variants:** Use `variant:` parameter for style variations
**Sizing:** Standardize on `size:` parameter (`:sm`, `:md`, `:lg`)
**Icons:** Reference Font Awesome icons by name (`:envelope`, `:github`)
**Testing:** Every component should have Lookbook previews demonstrating variants
